<view class="page"><view class="title">未来15天天气</view><button bindtap="locations">{{place.name}} · 选择全国地点 ↗</button><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="sub">天气加载中…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="sub">{{error}}</view><view class="card"><view class="trend" wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="date" bindtap="detail" data-date="{{item.date}}"><view>{{item.date}}</view><view>{{item.temp}}<view class="sub">日出 {{item.sunrise}} · 日落 {{item.sunset}} · UV {{item.uv}}</view></view><view class="small">{{item.rain}} ↗</view></view></view><view class="sub">降水概率 · 数据来自Open-Meteo · 远期预报存在不确定性，不补模拟数据。</view></view>
